# SPA build inputs are copied explicitly by the frontend-build stage; never ship the
# local node_modules / previous build output into the build context. The output now lives
# in frontend/ itself (index.html + assets/ + ruffle/ + favicon.svg), hence the odd names.
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/index.html
frontend/assets/
frontend/ruffle/
frontend/favicon.svg
frontend/dist/
artifacts/
